Package: spaced-mate-default-settings
Version: 8.26.3
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Spaced Linux Team
Depends: accountsservice, caja-admin, dconf-gsettings-backend, gigolo, gnome-keyring, libcanberra-gtk3-module, timeshift, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Provides: debian-mate-default-settings (= 1.26.1-3), mint-mate-default-settings, ubuntu-mate-default-settings
Conflicts: debian-mate-default-settings, mint-mate-default-settings, ubuntu-mate-default-settings
Replaces: debian-mate-default-settings, mint-mate-default-settings, ubuntu-mate-default-settings
Description: Spaced Linux desktop settings and integration
 Supplies the MATE defaults capability required by mate-session-manager and
 the maintained Spaced desktop themes, icons, utilities, panel layouts, and
 integration defaults. Upgrading this package delivers Spaced desktop fixes
 to an installed system without requiring a new ISO.
